# meso-pi cron entries. __HOME__ is replaced with the install directory
# by install.sh. Times are the Pi's local time.
# Submit a reading once an hour, at :12 past the hour. The script itself
# enforces the 50-minute minimum interval, so a run that lands too soon
# after the last submission skips quietly.
12 * * * * python3 __HOME__/scripts/meso-submit.py >> __HOME__/log/meso-submit.log 2>&1
